      <trans-unit id="about.headline" datatype="html">
        <source> Unindo a mente analítica da tecnologia com a disciplina dos tatames. </source>
        <target> Uniting the analytical mind of technology with the discipline of the mats. </target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="about.paragraph1" datatype="html">
        <source> Olá! Sou o <x id="START_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;strong class=&quot;text-foreground&quot;&gt;"/>Vinicius de Paiva Dionizio<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/>, desenvolvedor focado em criar experiências digitais modernas, fluidas e robustas. No mundo dos códigos e sistemas, busco constantemente as melhores práticas de arquitetura de software, novas linguagens e a evolução contínua das stacks que domino. </source>
        <target> Hi! I'm <x id="START_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;strong class=&quot;text-foreground&quot;&gt;"/>Vinicius de Paiva Dionizio<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/>, a developer focused on building modern, fluid and robust digital experiences. In the world of code and systems, I'm constantly pursuing software architecture best practices, new languages, and the continuous evolution of the stacks I work with. </target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="about.paragraph2" datatype="html">
        <source> Fora das telas, sou conhecido no mundo dos combates como <x id="START_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;strong class=&quot;text-foreground&quot;&gt;"/>Vinicius Dionizio<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/>. Minha trajetória no kickboxing, competindo em diversos eventos importantes da modalidade, me ensinou valores que carrego diretamente para o meu dia a dia como engenheiro de software. </source>
        <target> Away from the screens, I'm known in the fighting world as <x id="START_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;strong class=&quot;text-foreground&quot;&gt;"/>Vinicius Dionizio<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/>. My journey in kickboxing, competing in several major events in the sport, taught me values I carry straight into my day-to-day as a software engineer. </target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="about.paragraph3" datatype="html">
        <source> A <x id="START_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;strong class=&quot;text-primary&quot;&gt;"/>disciplina<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/> e o <x id="START_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;strong class=&quot;text-primary&quot;&gt;"/>foco<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/> extremos exigidos nos treinos intensivos se convertem na minha persistência para debugar cenários complexos e otimizar códigos até o seu melhor rendimento. Além disso, a habilidade de <x id="START_TAG_STRONG_1" ctype="x-strong_1" equiv-text="&lt;strong class=&quot;text-accent&quot;&gt;"/>manter a calma sob pressão<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/> — vital durante um combate — me permite encarar desafios técnicos, prazos rigorosos e incidentes críticos com total serenidade, mantendo sempre o foco claro na solução. </source>
        <target> The extreme <x id="START_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;strong class=&quot;text-primary&quot;&gt;"/>discipline<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/> and <x id="START_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;strong class=&quot;text-primary&quot;&gt;"/>focus<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/> demanded by intense training carry over into my persistence for debugging complex scenarios and optimizing code to its best performance. On top of that, the ability to <x id="START_TAG_STRONG_1" ctype="x-strong_1" equiv-text="&lt;strong class=&quot;text-accent&quot;&gt;"/>stay calm under pressure<x id="CLOSE_TAG_STRONG" ctype="x-strong" equiv-text="&lt;/strong&gt;"/> — vital during a fight — lets me face technical challenges, tight deadlines and critical incidents with complete composure, always keeping a clear focus on the solution. </target>
      </trans-unit>
      <trans-unit id="about.paragraph4" datatype="html">
        <source> Acredito que o desenvolvimento de alto nível não se trata apenas de escrever linhas de código, mas sim de entregar soluções eficientes e bem desenhadas, mantendo a perseverança diante dos desafios. Estou sempre aberto a novos aprendizados e parcerias para construir o futuro da tecnologia. </source>
        <target> I believe high-level development isn't just about writing lines of code, but about delivering efficient, well-designed solutions while staying persistent in the face of challenges. I'm always open to new learning and partnerships to help build the future of technology. </target>
      </trans-unit>
